 0.6584 0.6893 0.6770 0.2123 0.1578 0.1446 0.1385 0.6914 0.7531 0.7778 0.7654</cell></row></table><note><p>UniversalRAG</p><p>According to the conversation, what category is the clothing in the picture?</p><p>Relevant clue snippets in the conversation history NaiveRAG The clothing in the picture is a fitted, knee-length dress.</p><p>A-Mem MemoryOS</p><p>Great! Let me start with the Cap-Sleeved Midi Dresses. Here's the first one.</p><p>Assistant</p><p>What do you think of this dress?</p><p>Lin This dress has such a striking metallic sheen-like it was made for evening lights. The bronze tones and scalloped stripes feel glamorous but still structured. It's definitely a confidence-boosting piece.</p><p>Here's the second dress.</p><p>Lin Aww, this one immediately gives off a softer energy. The floral pattern feels calming in contrast to the first one.</p><p>More conversation on Cap-Sleeved Midi Dresses with more visual examples…</p></note></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div type=\"references\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<listBibl>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b0\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Josh</forename><surname>Achiam</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Steven</forename><surname>Adler</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Sandhini</forename><surname>Agarwal</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Lama</forename><surname>Ahmad</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Ilge</forename><surname>Akkaya</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Florencia</forename><surname>Leoni Aleman</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Diogo</forename><surname>Almeida</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName>